    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "### Is your feature request related to a problem? Please describe.\n\nIn my code, I would like to do\n```cython\nPyWeakref_IsDead(...)\n```\n\n\n### Describe the solution you'd like.\n\nAdd a declaration of `PyWeakref_IsDead` (https://docs.python.org/3/c-api/weakref.html#c.PyWeakref_IsDead, Python >= 3.14) to `cpython.weakref`.\n\nInclude a backport to Python < 3.14, as already done for `PyWeakref_GetRef` in \nhttps://github.com/cython/cython/blob/master/Cython/Includes/cpython/weakref.pxd#L27\n\n\n\n### Describe alternatives you've considered.\n\nHolding the strong reference and immediately releasing it.\n\n### Additional context\n\nhttps://github.com/passagemath/passagemath/pull/1787#issuecomment-3507636938",
    "closed_at": null,
    "closed_by": null,
    "comment_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Note that you can always declare the function yourself in your code, similar to how it's done in `weakref.pxd`. But we'd be happy to receive a PR that adds it directly to that file.",
